# The Rust images are built from the repository root, because one file they compile in - the gateway's routing manifest - sits
# under gateway/ and a context of rust/ alone cannot see it. Everything the build does not need is kept out of the context.

.git
.github
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.dart_tool
**/build
apps/flutter/**/build
*.db
*.db-journal
**/*.pyc
.DS_Store
